<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh central bank reserves fall in September.</title>
<headline>Kazakh central bank reserves fall in September.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Kazakhstan's reserves of foreign exchange and precious metals fell in September to $1.22 billion from $1.23 billion in August, the bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> KAZAKHSTAN FOREX RESERVES ($ BILLION)  Sep 1    Aug 1    Sep 95</p>
<p> Net foreign reserves			 1.223    1.231    n/a</p>
<p>  including gold				0.612    0.601    0.477</p>
<p>--Timur Nurpeisov, Almaty newsroom, (3272) 509410</p>
</text>
